          "description": "You are building a Natural Language Processing (NLP) model. You have a text corpus of 10 million words and need to quickly check if a specific word exists in your known vocabulary before processing it. Which data structure should you use to store the unique vocabulary words for the fastest lookup?",
          "choices": [
