            "starterCode": "raw_data = [15, 2, 33, 4, 18, 9]\n\n# Write your list comprehension below:\n",
            "solution": "raw_data = [15, 2, 33, 4, 18, 9]\neven_nums = [x for x in raw_data if x % 2 == 0]\nprint(even_nums)",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Use 'for x in raw_data' and the modulo operator 'if x % 2 == 0' to check for even numbers."
          }
