                "text": "We tell the algorithm to find 4 clusters (K=4). Notice we only use 'X' (Features). There is no 'y' (Labels) in unsupervised learning!",
                "code": "X = df[['Age', 'Income']]\n\n# Instantiate and fit the model\nmodel = KMeans(n_clusters=4)\nmodel.fit(X)"
              },
              {
                "label": "4. Get Results",
                "text": "The algorithm assigns a cluster number (0, 1, 2, or 3) to every customer.",
