                "Less Data",
                "To be deleted"
              ],
              "answer": 0
            },
            {
              "question": "High Variance is mathematically tied to which problem?",
              "options": [
                "Underfitting",
                "Overfitting",
                "Perfect Generalization",
                "Data Leakage"
