          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Building a Chatbot",
            "explanation": "So far, we have learned how to send a single prompt to an LLM and receive a response.but a chatbot stores conversation history and continuously sends messages to the LLM.\n\n**Workflow:**\nUser: What is the capital of France?\nAI: Paris.\nUser: What famous tower is located there?\nAI: The Eiffel Tower.\nUser: When was it built?\nAI: It was completed in 1889.",
            "example": "messages=[]\n\nmessages.append({'role':'user','content':'Hello'})\n\nresponse=client.chat.completions.create(\n model='gpt-4o-mini',\n messages=messages\n)\n\nreply=response.choices[0].message.content\nprint(reply)",
            "tip": "Store previous messages to maintain conversation context."
          }
        },
