            "solution": "transcript = \"\"\"\nAlex: Alright, let's start. We need to finalize the Q3 marketing budget.\nSarah: I think $50k is enough for ad spend.\nAlex: Agreed. Sarah, can you draft the ad copy by Friday?\nSarah: Sure. What about the website redesign?\nAlex: I will talk to the dev team about that tomorrow.\n\"\"\"\n\n# TODO: Write a prompt to extract Action Items and Key Decisions.\nprompt = \"\"\"Analyze the following meeting transcript and extract the core information.\nFormat your response using Markdown with the following two sections:\n\n Key Decisions\n- (List any finalized decisions or agreements)\n\n Action Items\n- [Name] - [Task] - [Deadline if mentioned]\n\nDo not include any conversational filler.\nTranscript: {transcript}\n\nTranscript: {transcript}\n\"\"\""
          }
