              "outcome": "Correct! Vector search understands concepts, not strict geographical rules. You MUST extract 'New Delhi' and pass it as a strict Metadata Filter (`where location == 'New Delhi'`) before running the vector search.",
              "score": 100
            },
            {
              "text": "The HNSW graph will crash due to polysemy.",
              "outcome": "Incorrect. HNSW handles complex concepts natively.",
              "score": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "mcq",
          "questions": [
            {
              "question": "Why might a company choose Pinecone over ChromaDB?",
              "options": [
                "Pinecone is fully managed and cloud-native",
                "Pinecone only works offline",
