        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Embed & Store (The Ingestion Hand-off)",
            "explanation": "We have loaded, cleaned, and chunked our documents. We have attached metadata. Now, we execute the final step of the **Ingestion Phase**.\n\n1. **Convert to Embeddings:** We pass every single text chunk through an Embedding Model (like OpenAI's `text-embedding-3`). This converts the human text into mathematical vectors (e.g., 1536-dimensional arrays).\n2. **Store in Vector Database:** We push the Vector, the original Text, and the Metadata into a Vector Database (like Pinecone, ChromaDB, or Weaviate).\n\nOur private knowledge base is now successfully digitized and ready for querying!\nNow, let's visualize this entire ingestion pipeline using the diagram below.",
            "html_code": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;padding:25px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:14px;\"><b style=\"display:block;text-align:center;color:#1d4ed8;\">RAG Ingestion Pipeline</b><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px;\"><div style=\"width:180px;padding:18px;background:#eff6ff;border:2px solid #60a5fa;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:42px;\">📄</div><h3 style=\"margin:10px 0 5px;color:#1d4ed8;\">Text Chunks</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;\">Small document chunks with metadata</p></div><div style=\"font-size:34px;color:#94a3b8;\">➡️</div><div style=\"width:200px;padding:18px;background:#f0fdf4;border:2px solid #4ade80;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:42px;\">🧠</div><h3 style=\"margin:10px 0 5px;color:#15803d;\">Embedding Model</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;\">Converts each chunk into a numerical vector</p><div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding:6px;background:#dcfce7;border-radius:6px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;color:#166534;\">[0.21, -0.54, 0.88, ...]</div></div><div style=\"font-size:34px;color:#94a3b8;\">➡️</div><div style=\"width:200px;padding:18px;background:#fefce8;border:2px solid #facc15;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-size:42px;\">🗄️</div><h3 style=\"margin:10px 0 5px;color:#a16207;\">Vector Database</h3><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin:0;\">Stores Vector + Original Text + Metadata</p><div style=\"margin-top:10px;font-size:12px;color:#a16207;font-weight:bold;\">Pinecone • ChromaDB • Weaviate</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:28px;padding:15px;background:#ecfeff;border-left:5px solid #06b6d4;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;\"><b style=\"color:#0f766e;\">Ingestion Complete</b><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#475569;margin-top:6px;\">Your knowledge base is now indexed and ready for semantic search and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "The Retrieval Phase: Semantic Search & Top-K",
            "explanation": "The system is live. A user types a question into your chatbot. This triggers the **Retrieval Phase**.\n\n1. **Query Embedding:** We take the user's exact question and embed it using the *same model* we used during ingestion.\n2. **Metadata Filtering (Hybrid Search):** Before searching the math, we apply hard SQL-style filters. (e.g., *Only search chunks where `date == 2024`*).\n3. **Similarity Search:** The Vector Database calculates the Cosine Similarity between the Query Vector and all the allowed Document Vectors.\n4. **Top-K Retrieval:** The database sorts the results from highest score to lowest score, and returns the 'Top-K' chunks (where K is a number you define, like the Top 5 most relevant paragraphs).\n\nThese Top-K chunks are then injected into the LLM's prompt to generate the final answer.",
            "html_code": "<div style=\"background: #18181b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 12px; color: #f4f4f5; font-family: monospace; border: 1px solid #3f3f46;\"><h4 style=\"color: #a78bfa; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Top-K = 3 Retrieval Results</h4><div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;\"><div style=\"background: #27272a; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #10b981;\"><span style=\"color: #10b981; font-weight: bold;\">[Rank 1] Sim: 0.92</span> -> \"To reset the router, hold the power button for 10 seconds.\"</div><div style=\"background: #27272a; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #84cc16;\"><span style=\"color: #84cc16; font-weight: bold;\">[Rank 2] Sim: 0.85</span> -> \"The router uses a 12V power supply.\"</div><div style=\"background: #27272a; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #eab308;\"><span style=\"color: #eab308; font-weight: bold;\">[Rank 3] Sim: 0.71</span> -> \"Router warranty lasts for 1 year.\"</div></div></div>"
          }
        },
