            "starterCode": "# retrieval.py\n\n# TODO:\n# Import the required libraries.\n\n# TODO:\n# Load the existing ChromaDB collection.\n\n# TODO:\n# Load the embedding model.\n\n# TODO:\n# Create a function to generate an embedding for the user's question.\ndef create_query_embedding(question):\n    pass\n\n# TODO:\n# Create a function to retrieve the most relevant document.\ndef retrieve_context(query_embedding):\n    pass\n\n# TODO:\n# Test the retrieval using a sample question.",
            "solution": "...",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Separate embedding generation and retrieval into two functions."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "challenge": {
            "title": "Step 3: Build the Complete RAG Application",
            "difficulty": "Medium",
            "question": "Complete the functions inside `main.py` to build the RAG prompt, call the LLM, and print the final answer.",
            "starterCode": "# main.py\n\n# TODO:\n# Import OpenAI and the helper functions from ingestion.py and retrieval.py.\n\n# TODO:\n# Initialize the OpenAI client.\n\n# TODO:\n# Create a function to build the RAG prompt using the retrieved context and user question.\ndef build_prompt(context, question):\n    pass\n\n# TODO:\n# Create a function that sends the prompt to the LLM and returns the response.\ndef generate_answer(prompt):\n    pass\n\n# TODO:\n# Write the main() function:\n# 1. Ask the user for a question.\n# 2. Retrieve the most relevant context.\n# 3. Build the RAG prompt.\n# 4. Generate the final answer.\n# 5. Print the answer.\n\ndef main():\n    pass\n\n# TODO:\n# Run the application.\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()",
            "solution": "...",
