            "starterCode": "from evaluate import load\n\ndef evaluate_outputs(predictions: list, references: list) -> float:\n    '''Compute average BERTScore F1 between predictions and references.'''\n    bertscore = load('bertscore')\n    results = bertscore.compute(\n        predictions=predictions,\n        references=references,\n        lang='en'\n    )\n    # Return the average F1 score\n    ___",
