            "solution": "from crewai import Agent, Task, Crew\n\nresearcher = Agent(\n    role='Senior Research Analyst',\n    goal='Find accurate and comprehensive information about the topic',\n    backstory='You are an expert researcher who finds accurate data.'\n)\n\nwriter = Agent(\n    role='Content Writer',\n    goal='Write clear, engaging summaries from research data',\n    backstory='You are a skilled writer who explains complex topics simply.'\n)\n\nresearch_task = Task(\n    description='Research AI agents: what they are, key frameworks, and use cases',\n    agent=researcher\n)\n\nwrite_task = Task(\n    description='Write a clear summary based on the research findings',\n    agent=writer\n)\n\ncrew = Crew(agents=[researcher, writer], tasks=[research_task, write_task])",
