            "starterCode": "def generate(task):\n    return f'Draft about: {task}'\n\ndef critique(content):\n    if 'improved' in content:\n        return 'LGTM - no issues found'\n    return 'Needs more detail and examples'\n\ndef improve(content, feedback):\n    return f'{content} (improved based on: {feedback})'\n\ndef reflection_agent(task, max_rounds=3):\n    # Step 1: Generate\n    output = ___\n    print(f'Initial: {output}')\n    \n    for round in range(max_rounds):\n        # Step 2: Critique\n        feedback = ___\n        print(f'Feedback: {feedback}')\n        \n        # Step 3: Check if good enough\n        if 'no issues' in feedback.lower():\n            break\n        \n        # Step 4: Improve\n        output = ___\n        print(f'Improved: {output}')\n    \n    return output\n\nresult = reflection_agent('Write about AI agents')\nprint(f'Final: {result}')",
            "solution": "def generate(task):\n    return f'Draft about: {task}'\n\ndef critique(content):\n    if 'improved' in content:\n        return 'LGTM - no issues found'\n    return 'Needs more detail and examples'\n\ndef improve(content, feedback):\n    return f'{content} (improved based on: {feedback})'\n\ndef reflection_agent(task, max_rounds=3):\n    output = generate(task)\n    print(f'Initial: {output}')\n    \n    for round in range(max_rounds):\n        feedback = critique(output)\n        print(f'Feedback: {feedback}')\n        \n        if 'no issues' in feedback.lower():\n            break\n        \n        output = improve(output, feedback)\n        print(f'Improved: {output}')\n    \n    return output\n\nresult = reflection_agent('Write about AI agents')\nprint(f'Final: {result}')",
            "hint": "Call generate(task), critique(output), and improve(output, feedback). Break when the critique says 'no issues'.",
            "explanation": "The Reflection pattern creates a self-improvement loop. The agent generates → critiques → improves until the output meets quality standards. This typically takes 2-3 rounds.",
            "concepts": [
              "Reflection",
              "Self-Improvement",
              "Iterative Refinement"
            ],
            "validation": {
              "type": "regex_match",
              "pattern": "generate.*critique.*no issues.*improve.*output.*feedback"
