            "title": "Capstone Project: Production-Ready API with CI/CD Pipeline",
            "explanation": "**Your Capstone Mission:**\n\nBuild a production-ready REST API for an AI-powered application, complete with authentication, rate limiting, error handling, logging, containerization, and a full CI/CD deployment pipeline.\n\n**What You Will Build:**\nA \"Smart Notes API\" — a backend service where users can create, search, and auto-tag notes using AI. The API will demonstrate all the backend development best practices you learned in this module.\n\n**Project Requirements:**\n\n1. **API Design** (FastAPI or Flask):\n   - RESTful endpoints: CRUD for notes + AI-powered search\n   - Request validation with Pydantic models\n   - Proper HTTP status codes and error responses\n   - API versioning (v1/notes, v2/notes)\n\n2. **Authentication & Security**:\n   - JWT-based authentication\n   - Role-based access control (admin, user)\n   - Rate limiting (100 requests/minute per user)\n   - Input sanitization against injection attacks\n\n3. **Database Integration**:\n   - PostgreSQL for structured data (users, notes metadata)\n   - Redis for caching and rate limiting\n   - Proper migrations with Alembic\n\n4. **AI Integration**:\n   - Auto-tag notes using an LLM\n   - Semantic search across notes using embeddings\n   - Smart summarization endpoint\n\n5. **DevOps & Deployment**:\n   - Dockerize the application\n   - Write a docker-compose.yml with API + DB + Redis\n   - Set up GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline\n   - Add health check and readiness endpoints\n\n6. **Testing & Monitoring**:\n   - Unit tests with pytest (80%+ coverage)\n   - Integration tests for API endpoints\n   - Structured logging with request tracing\n   - Error tracking setup\n\n**API Endpoints:**\n```\nPOST   /api/v1/auth/register\nPOST   /api/v1/auth/login\nGET    /api/v1/notes          (list user's notes)\nPOST   /api/v1/notes          (create + auto-tag)\nGET    /api/v1/notes/{id}     \nPUT    /api/v1/notes/{id}\nDELETE /api/v1/notes/{id}\nPOST   /api/v1/notes/search   (semantic search)\nGET    /api/v1/health\n```\n\n**Stretch Goals:**\n- Add WebSocket support for real-time collaboration\n- Implement API documentation with Swagger/OpenAPI\n- Set up Prometheus metrics and Grafana dashboard\n\nThis is your complete backend engineering capstone!"
