          "type": "concept",
          "content": {
            "title": "Production Resilience — When Things Go Wrong",
            "explanation": "Production systems WILL fail. The difference between a good and great engineer is how gracefully the system handles failure.\n\n**Common LLM Production Failures:**\n\n1. **API Rate Limiting** — You exceeded the provider's request limit\n2. **Model Timeout** — The LLM took too long to respond\n3. **Context Window Overflow** — Input exceeded the model's token limit\n4. **Invalid Output Format** — The LLM didn't follow the structured output format\n5. **Provider Outage** — OpenAI/Anthropic is down\n\n**Resilience Patterns:**\n\n**1. Retry with Exponential Backoff:**\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom tenacity import retry, stop_after_attempt, wait_exponential\n\n@retry(\n    stop=stop_after_attempt(3),\n    wait=wait_exponential(multiplier=1, min=1, max=10)\n)\nasync def call_llm(prompt: str) -> str:\n    return await client.chat.completions.create(\n        model='gpt-4o-mini',\n        messages=[{'role': 'user', 'content': prompt}]\n    )\n# Attempt 1: immediate\n# Attempt 2: wait 1s\n# Attempt 3: wait 2s\n```\n\n**2. Model Fallback Chain:**\n```python\nasync def resilient_llm(prompt: str) -> str:\n    models = ['gpt-4o', 'gpt-4o-mini', 'claude-3-haiku']\n    \n    for model in models:\n        try:\n            return await call_model(model, prompt)\n        except (RateLimitError, TimeoutError):\n            continue\n    \n    return 'Our AI is temporarily unavailable. Please try again.'\n```\n\n**3. Circuit Breaker:**\n```python\nclass CircuitBreaker:\n    def __init__(self, failure_threshold=5, recovery_timeout=60):\n        self.failures = 0\n        self.threshold = failure_threshold\n        self.state = 'closed'  # closed = working, open = failing\n    \n    def call(self, func, *args):\n        if self.state == 'open':\n            return fallback_response()  # Don't even try\n        \n        try:\n            result = func(*args)\n            self.failures = 0\n            return result\n        except Exception:\n            self.failures += 1\n            if self.failures >= self.threshold:\n                self.state = 'open'  # Stop calling failing service\n            raise\n```\n\n**4. Graceful Degradation:**\nIf the primary AI fails, provide a useful but limited fallback:\n- Full AI response → Cached similar response → FAQ lookup → 'Contact support'\n\n**Monitoring Checklist:**\n- [ ] Error rate by model/endpoint (alert if > 2%)\n- [ ] P95 latency (alert if > 5 seconds)\n- [ ] Daily cost (alert if > budget)\n- [ ] Hallucination rate (alert if > 10%)\n- [ ] User satisfaction (thumbs up/down ratio)\n- [ ] Token usage trends (detect anomalies)"
          }
        },
