            "title": "Build an LLM-as-Judge Evaluator",
            "question": "Create a function that uses GPT-4o-mini as a judge to evaluate an AI response. The judge should score the response on accuracy (1-5) and helpfulness (1-5), returning the scores as a dictionary.",
            "starterCode": "from openai import OpenAI\nimport json\n\nclient = OpenAI()\n\ndef judge_response(question: str, response: str, reference: str) -> dict:\n    judge_prompt = f\"\"\"Evaluate this AI response.\n\nQuestion: {question}\nAI Response: {response}\nReference Answer: {reference}\n\nScore on:\n- accuracy (1-5): Is the information correct?\n- helpfulness (1-5): Does it fully answer the question?\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON: {{\"accuracy\": X, \"helpfulness\": X}}\"\"\"\n\n    # Call the judge model and parse the JSON response\n    # Return the scores as a dictionary",
            "solution": "from openai import OpenAI\nimport json\n\nclient = OpenAI()\n\ndef judge_response(question: str, response: str, reference: str) -> dict:\n    judge_prompt = f\"\"\"Evaluate this AI response.\n\nQuestion: {question}\nAI Response: {response}\nReference Answer: {reference}\n\nScore on:\n- accuracy (1-5): Is the information correct?\n- helpfulness (1-5): Does it fully answer the question?\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON: {{\"accuracy\": X, \"helpfulness\": X}}\"\"\"\n\n    result = client.chat.completions.create(\n        model='gpt-4o-mini',\n        messages=[{'role': 'user', 'content': judge_prompt}],\n        temperature=0\n    )\n    \n    scores = json.loads(result.choices[0].message.content)\n    return scores",
            "language": "python",
            "hint": "Call client.chat.completions.create with the judge_prompt, then parse the JSON response using json.loads on the message content."
          }
