          "type": "reflection",
          "prompt": "You've now learned the complete deployment pipeline: from packaging code with Docker, scaling with Kubernetes, deploying on cloud providers, running local inference, choosing GPU hardware, automating with CI/CD, and monitoring with observability tools. Describe in your own words how you would deploy an AI chatbot from your laptop to production, step by step.",
