        {
          "type": "reflection",
          "prompt": "🎉 Congratulations! You've built a complete, production-grade AI Customer Intelligence Platform from scratch — from opening VS Code to deploying on the cloud.\n\nReflect on your journey through all 20 modules:\n- Which module's knowledge was most critical for this capstone project?\n- What was the most challenging phase to implement?\n- If you were building this for a real company, what would you add next?\n- How would you explain what you built to a non-technical person?\n\nWrite a short summary of the project as if it were for your portfolio or resume.",
